Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H6356AC&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕組
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,貨車會從東邊進入夜之城
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我們要在市郊奪取整車
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,報酬是250萬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,大家按照平常的份額瓜分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.76,0:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對是我成為賽博龐克以來 接到最大的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,反正目標是公司狗 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.17,0:02:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概能猜到 我們要在哪位太歲頭上動土了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,當然是荒坂了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在擔心50萬幹一票 值得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,再說了 我們人手夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,護衛隊的安保規模特別小
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,看來荒坂刻意壓低人數 避免引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.75,0:02:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那裡就是我們此次進攻的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,確定嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不要想得太複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,取走目標貨物 交給客戶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.36,0:02:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,和平常一樣的差事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,和平常一樣的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你認為他扛得住義體金剛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,從大衛適應斯安威斯坦的那一刻起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,就吸引了荒坂公司的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,田中把他召回學院 為的就是實驗義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,而這女孩企圖損壞數據 避免他們找上門
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.14,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,還打算掩蓋一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來是的 田中的腦子也是露西燒掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.86,0:03:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩和多莉歐只是附帶的犧牲品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,從結果上看 確實如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,長相可愛 但真是個可怕的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,為了救心上人 她還會殺多少人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在更深層的潛入中發現 她曾經是荒坂的資產
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是被遣送到舊網的駭客戰士
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才知道如何通過荒坂的ICE
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.68,0:03:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是天降驚喜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,與荒坂的談判多了張好牌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,靠著她飛升公司的頂端 不再是夢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是你的目標嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.28,0:04:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,中間人不就是餵飽賽博龐克的聖光飼養員嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,想在夜之城出人頭地的方法只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.11,0:04:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,爬上公司的頂端
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來 我還會需要你的協助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,都這樣了 你還要我繼續背叛他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.22,0:04:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,這對你來說 也是千載難逢的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,田中的案子我拿到了公司豁免 可是你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你還是一樣笑裡藏刀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看在往日情誼的份上 我們好好合作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂要什麼給什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.95,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,同時還可以給軍用科技放消息
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂一定不會拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我幫你談妥公司豁免權和酬勞
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在夜之城不要相信任何人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.83,0:04:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,被利用了也是自己的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛也是談判的籌碼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:05:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,當然了 我有個好計策
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.62,0:05:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我會向荒坂提出獻上他們兩個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 有個大案子想委託你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,緊急會議是什麼情況
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第的委託
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是目前最大的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,高風險高回報
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沒準備好的話 現在反悔還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.59,0:05:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇 我也需要你的幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老頭老太太都可以輕鬆搞定嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我還怕你孤單呢 小妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,殺了你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.49,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,任務內容是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.27,0:05:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,安保隊伍很小 但槍火很重
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一半會跟法拉第安插好的分流小組走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,分流小組
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,基本上就是誘餌 當然他們自己應該不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第的典型做派
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,當然 我們是否是誘餌也無從得知
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.83,0:06:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,讓他們分成三組
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.56,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,現在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,主要目標偏離道路 機會來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,換檔 法爾科
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.55,0:07:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這就來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.51,0:07:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,就這樣踩油門
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 車已經準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.71,0:07:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這些全是免疫抑制劑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.52,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,幫我拿上我媽的外套好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這工作我們不做了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,麗貝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.44,0:07:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我有個請求
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.95,0:07:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,麗貝卡 除了你以外 我沒有人可託付了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,麗貝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣對我太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不許你用斯安威斯坦 聽見沒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,幹掉一個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 我們已經緊緊咬住目標了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我來駭入剎車系統
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 後方有敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.67,0:08:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,片刻不得安寧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,交給我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不准用斯安威斯坦…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,護航車奪取成功
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我們直接撞上目標
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,麗貝卡 把電擊彈送到貨櫃上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.48,0:08:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,講真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.40,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我們這隊長…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.69,0:08:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是瘋了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,大家還好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,臭鬍子 你看不見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那個武裝怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ICE也很厚 黑不進去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那我從前面打爆它
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是夠了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,真是受夠了 聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有司機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.46,0:09:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這東西是自動駕駛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,偷襲正如期進行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他們的舉動和我們計劃的一致
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,做得非常好 法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都很順利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,消息也透露給軍用科技了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就會拿到義體金剛的實戰數據了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,當然 前提是大衛能駕馭義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.42,0:09:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他失敗的話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.84,0:09:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的搶救小隊 就會跟軍用科技正面對上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是大衛和軍用科技先動上手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的棋子會聽我命令行事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你保持安全距離 觀賞即可
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,得在它掉下去之前攔住它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.31,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 我們從現在起不做了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…你將如何決定呢 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.14,0:10:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,到懸崖邊緣了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法爾科 開近一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.55,0:10:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,朝我的方向發射魚叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,等我口號 踩剎車
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,計劃是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼搞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,丟就丟 我來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 振作一點 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,事情變得複雜 你就又想逃避了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,自己來做選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是獨特的 還記得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,剎車
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,踩下去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.85,0:11:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我們辦到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,真沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妙極了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然派高級浮空車來接一個女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真是個身價不菲的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.08,0:12:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,還是沒有露西的消息嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,現在多一個網路駭客能幫上什麼忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,還得多一個分錢的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊進展得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可能要花點時間才撬得開
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我覺得貨車無人駕駛怪怪的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你確定是荒坂的運輸車嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼擔心的話 拿到貨物就走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那就快打開啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,少囉嗦 我們去開車
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.43,0:13:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才在追貨車的時候還沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.03,0:13:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡這麼開闊 如果有人偷襲 我們就死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,從剛才開始 你就那麼緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你的鬍子是你渾身上下 唯一有膽量的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我怕剃掉鬍子 你會愛上我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,閉嘴 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,別躲啊 大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,看來誘餌失敗 他們回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.85,0:13:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,魔蜥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,還有導彈車
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.99,0:13:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,軍用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什麼 為什麼軍用科技偷襲我們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第是軍用科技的人 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,太蹊蹺了 這工作越來越奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,打開了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,真快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在外面會被射死 總之先進來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.23,0:14:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼鬼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是法拉第要曼恩找的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.11,0:14:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,軍事級別的植入體
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,軍事級別…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你是說像大衛的斯安威斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,據我所知
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,完全和斯安威斯坦不同口徑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這小子的斯安威斯坦已經夠嚇人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次聽說這樣的情報
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.39,0:14:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,這情報的真實度未知
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不過荒坂認為
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要將這個投向市場 他們就能壓倒軍用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:15:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,所以一直在秘密研發這套義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大部分數據都壓在田中手裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不曉得法拉第是從哪裡得知
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但他竟然答應洩露情報給軍用科技 看來交易不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每天都有榮幸橫越夜之城上空
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你們習慣泡冰池 這裡景色很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,助我一臂之力如何 讓你的意中人飛起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1009.2,500.8)}{\shad0\bord1\fs40\c&H2425A5&\pos(318,152)\3c&HFFFFFF&}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord0\fs45\c&H2425A5&\frz358.4\pos(318,152)\frx358\fry4}露西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,露西的電話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 現在這個節骨眼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 你去哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,沒時間了 軍用科技已經到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.80,0:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道這些 你人在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他們也找上我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.96,0:15:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.78,0:15:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,再這樣下去 所有人都會死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,想活命的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:15:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就裝上義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快點 大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.47,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,趁現在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 我相信你辦得到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,想活命的話 就裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.15,0:16:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但露西感覺不太對勁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我們怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在追殺她 無論如何 我都必須安裝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這台貨車是移動義體安裝單元
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,平台把安裝器設定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.20,0:16:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,難道你真的要安裝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼樣 要先把大家救出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你瘋了嗎 我告訴你別裝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不安裝 我們全都會死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在真的很想把你揍扁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我去開車
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,上回我安裝了不是自己的義體 可是被曼恩狠揍一頓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs100\frz358.3\org(-39,520)\frx28\fry10\pos(307.933,258.4)}{\fax0.4}進行安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs100\frz358.3\org(-39,520)\frx28\fry10\pos(282.599,294.4)}{\fax0.4}進行安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(291.932,290.4)}{\fs100\frz358.3\org(-39,520)\frx28\fry10\pos(282.599,294.4)}{\fax0.4}進行安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs100\frz358.3\frx28\fry10\pos(719.932,330.4)\org(326,544)}{\fax0.4}進行安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs65\frz358.3\frx28\fry10\pos(1755.932,282.4)\org(684.666,640)}{\fax0.4}進行安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0}{\fs35\frz358.3\frx28\fry10\pos(1999.932,286.4)\org(923.333,672)}{\fax0.4}進行安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事還是不會改變
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然真的裝了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這個大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,960)}{\pos(429.333,410)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}安裝進度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,960)}{\pos(1067.666,410)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,軍用科技為何停火
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.53,0:17:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我完成我的工作 要撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,非常優秀 軍用科技會讓你過去的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.89,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在老地方會合
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.39,0:17:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛 不要安裝義體金剛 那是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 怎麼了 你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是法拉第 全部都是他策劃的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第跟荒坂是一伙兒的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,目的就是要你安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他要用你對抗軍用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.13,0:18:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,然後荒坂搶救小組會過來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.89,0:18:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不要安裝義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你以為我們不懂裝保險裝置嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fax0.1\fs35\bord0\c&H7AEFF8&\frx358\fry10\frz353.1\move(978.666,576.666,1835.999,407.332,7,1967)}通往小中國南部
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,軍用科技只想得到義體金剛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,丟下它 快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,要在後腦再開個深潛介面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,露西 發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她現在恐怕無法聽電話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.17,0:18:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,任務進行得還順利
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.67,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 你把露西怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,給我背後捅刀子的女人 正被我踩在腳下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.51,0:18:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定會好好整治她的腦子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這還遠遠不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的臭腳移開
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看來這筆高額交易 荒坂要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我現在就去交貨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,等會就由荒坂來照顧她了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.11,0:19:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\pos(276,328.666)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}安裝進度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\pos(1104.999,328.666)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在快速失去人格意識
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣下去 還沒等裝完就會變成賽博瘋子的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你現在被軍用科技的精英部隊包圍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快安裝義體金剛 看看自己能不能逃得掉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我個人賭你扛不住 但荒坂非常看好你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真有自己說的那份獨特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就用行動證明給我看 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\move(1219.667,296,1190.334,316,0,967)}{\shad0\bord0\fs50\t(0,970,\fs55)\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.65,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,殺了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.94,0:19:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我要殺了他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(546.333,634)}{\shad0\bord0\fs90\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.61,0:19:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(993,434)}{\shad0\bord0\fs70\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1147.667,344.667)}{\shad0\bord0\fs60\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1213,306)}{\shad0\bord0\fs55\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1235.667,291.333)}{\shad0\bord0\fs50\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\pos(1151.666,343.332)}{\shad0\bord0\fs48\c&H2425A5&}義體融合度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去救露西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.20,0:20:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 你果然瘋了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第在背後捅我們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他綁走了露西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.58,0:20:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那個王八蛋 我永遠不會放過他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我發誓把他碎屍萬段
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.79,0:20:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,法爾科 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,琦薇背叛了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她把我們引到陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那個臭老太婆也和他們一伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會讓她得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,軍用科技的人都瘋了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我從來沒看過這副景象
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼有辦法戴著這個走路
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,內部有兩個浮空車壓縮推進器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,還有荒坂設計的重力變更原型機
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能產生重力磁場 改變磁極
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.01,0:21:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那是磁力產生器
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一瞬間就把他們都打爆了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.19,0:21:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他同時也在用斯安威斯坦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,飛起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是重力場
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但這個科技還在實驗中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,其控制太過複雜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,義體承載人的神經系統是否能夠承受 完全無法保證
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,需要超乎常人的堅毅心智 才能對抗這樣的植入體
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,幾乎是通向賽博精神病的單程票
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他被幹掉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.35,0:22:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.04,0:22:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,身體是沒事 但…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,每使用一次 就距離過載更進一步
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但他短暫獲得的超強戰力…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.99,0:22:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.2\fs60\frz336\pos(676,347.333)}{\bord0\c&H6BFF5F&}威脅已完全排除
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.99,0:22:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,遠遠
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,超出我們的想像…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.00,0:23:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大衛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.55,0:23:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,法拉第背叛我們 我們要找他算帳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.73,0:23:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要救出露西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.17,0:23:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你這麼說 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.10,0:23:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,同甘共苦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我的原則
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.20,0:23:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 小子 我們跟你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.65,0:23:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,直奔地獄吧
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.42,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.77,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.32,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.73,0:00:42.50,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.56,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.36,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.21,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.03,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.42,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.49,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.34,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.16,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.55,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:01:29.16,0:01:31.16,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.03,0:00:21.42,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:27.77,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼著甜蜜殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.32,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}現在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:42.50,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我殘軀化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.85,0:01:11.56,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}這簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.36,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.21,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.21,0:01:14.03,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.42,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:25.49,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}讓我把這座城市燒成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.16,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.55,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}燒成灰
Comment: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:38.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.77,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:59.20,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:03.54,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:07.90,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:12.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:16.12,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.49,0:24:21.03,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:24.85,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.05,0:24:28.65,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:33.90,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:37.10,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.94,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:48.30,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:52.63,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:59.92,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:25:00.48,0:25:02.48,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.77,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他們終究會擦出愛情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.77,0:23:59.20,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化為血液 在我體內流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.20,0:24:03.54,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我會引燃這座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:07.90,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們從未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.66,0:24:12.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去獲得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.72,0:24:16.12,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為讓你見我所見
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.49,0:24:21.03,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:24.85,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你無法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.05,0:24:28.65,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 讓你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.54,0:24:33.90,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}請原諒我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:37.10,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想還未擁有守護你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.72,0:24:40.94,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只為此時
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:48.30,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:52.63,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我們永恆的愛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.63,0:24:59.92,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分離
Comment: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
